MEASURED|subject=the_prism_decorrelates_its_own_lanes|evidence=24 of 27 spectral lanes carry no detectable signal about lanes 1,2,3: a stable single-pass classifier reaches 364 permille against a 342 permille majority baseline, a margin of 22 inside a 18 permille standard error|samples=2222|held_out=667|reading=this is what an exact NTT is SUPPOSED to do - spread information so no subset of lanes predicts another|tag=MEASURED_no_detectable_signal_at_this_sample_size_with_these_two_classifiers|NOT_claimed=provable statistical independence; absence of detection by two classifiers is not a proof of independence|falsifier=any classifier beating the majority baseline by more than 2 sigma on these 24 lanes|json=0
MYFAULT|subject=dead_band_carried_from_another_scale|fault=DEAD=26 against a max reachable inner sum of 24 pinned every hidden unit to Nil|symptom=358 permille frozen identically across all 40 epochs; 667 of 667 stones tie-broken to BLUE and reported as carried|tell=a learning net does not score identically forty times|law=a dead band is a fraction of the fan-in, never an absolute; a constant from another scale is not a constant|second_fault=max_by_key silently returns the LAST maximum, so a full three-way tie looked like a confident BLUE vote|second_fix=argmax now reports ties as no-decision and they are counted, never scored as correct|third_fault=the collapse check asked only is_it_exactly_one_class, so ZERO classes carried fell through to spread and read as healthy|severity_trit=t5|json=0
